      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper is Part of the review concerning the influence of weak electromagnetic fields on humans and animals under real and experimental conditions. It shows that participation of melatonin in the mechanism of such influence is responsible for desynchronization of circadian rhythms. Interestingly, preventive treatment with melatonin helps to eliminate negative impacts of the Earth's weather on patients with hypertensive disease."},
